paid up to time $t$. To extend the definition of $L_{t}$ for all
$t\geq0$, let us consider $L_{t}$ constant after the minimum between
$\overline{\tau}$ and the ruin time. The dividend payment strategy is
admissible if it is non-decreasing, c\`{a}dl\`{a}g (right-continuous with left
limits), adapted to $\left(  \mathcal{F}_{t}^{\mathbf{\lambda}%
}\right)  _{t\geq0}$, and satisfies $L_{0}\geq0$ and $L_{t}\leq X_{t}$ for
