In principle, we can choose fully independent NNN exchange couplings to lift the magnon bands degeneracy and obtain spin-split magnon bands. However, such generality leads to cumbersome calculations. To simplify the analysis while preserving the essential physics, we adopt a symmetric anisotropic pattern for the exchange couplings. Specifically, for sublattice A, we set, 
