Indeed, Trump's Subreddit shows a greater proportion of negative sentiment user histories and posts, thus the sentiment of generated comments in Scenarios 1 and 2, as well as in the null model, tends to be more negative in his Subreddit than in Clinton's. However, negative sentiment is surprisingly more prevalent in Clinton's Subreddit in Scenario 3.

