    $n$ lines $p_{k,0}\cap p_{k+2,0},\ldots,p_{k,n-1}\cap p_{k+2,n-1}$ lie in one isotropic plane for each $0\le k\le m-3$ or $m$ lines $p_{0,l}\cap p_{0,l+2},\ldots,p_{m-1,l}\cap p_{m-1,l+2}$ lie in one isotropic plane for each $0\le l\le n-3$;
