the weights are the same. 

The usage of the gradual approach with  metric~\eqref{eq:epsilon-metric} plays a critical role (see Fig.~\ref{fig:GGG_fail}). For less constrained webs (i.e., GGG and AAG webs), it prevents drastic changes from the initial shapes. In the case of AGAG-webs its role is even more significant, as optimization consistently failed without this approach (see supplementary materials for details).

